<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-ST Computer half yr net up 15.8 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ST Computer half yr net up 15.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   3.64    vs     3.14</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		  3.64    vs     3.14</p>
<p>    Turnover			   152.87    vs   154.10</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest    1.28    vs     0.69</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		 1.89    vs     1.38</p>
<p>    Depreciation and amortisation  3.96    vs     3.53</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     5.12    vs     5.22</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	  1.45    vs    (0.09)</p>
<p>    Tax				    2.37    vs     1.74</p>
<p>    Minorities			  (0.56)   vs    (0.24)</p>
<p>Note - ST Computer Systems and Services Ltd is involved in computer and computer-related industries.</p>
